tmux.pane_movements provides four pane-navigation executables:

  to-left-pane
  to-lower-pane
  to-right-pane
  to-upper-pane

When the current window has multiple panes, they select the adjacent tmux pane.
In a single-pane window, they send Ctrl-W plus the direction to Vim/Neovim, or
forward the corresponding Alt chord to other applications.
